Package: lplot
Title: Responsive Scene Graphs for R Graphics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("lplot", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lplot@example.org")
Description: Extract semantic elements from ggplot2 graphics and compose them
    with logical lengths, anchors, constraints and nested viewports. Layout is
    resolved for each rendering context and drawn using native grid graphics.
    Optional image devices export scenes to JPEG, PNG, SVG and WebP files.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), grid, gtable
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), vdiffr, svglite, sf, ragg, webp, png, jpeg
Config/testthat/edition: 3
